      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/3/f34c9de31e873170ba4f8eb5fbf4be6e197984b7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f34c9de31e873170ba4f8eb5fbf4be6e197984b7\" title=\"ScreenShot_2026-01-15_210301_658\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/3/f34c9de31e873170ba4f8eb5fbf4be6e197984b7_2_372x500.png\" alt=\"ScreenShot_2026-01-15_210301_658\" data-base62-sha1=\"yIkaUjVOSaAF0j0hbcS4kl68QCP\" width=\"372\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/3/f34c9de31e873170ba4f8eb5fbf4be6e197984b7_2_372x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/3/f34c9de31e873170ba4f8eb5fbf4be6e197984b7_2_558x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/3/f34c9de31e873170ba4f8eb5fbf4be6e197984b7_2_744x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ScreenShot_2026-01-15_210301_658</span><span class=\"informations\">1254×1684 156 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The top-left navigation currently carries too many responsibilities. Most of the features shown in the screenshot (e.g., user personalization tools) are low-frequency, user-specific functions. Moving these items to the bottom-left corner would be more logical. This would allow the top-left area to focus solely on a minimalist app-switching function—one click to display and switch between all apps—making the interface cleaner and more efficient.</p>",
